{"time_ns": 1794069976198837000, "kind": "result", "action_index": 12, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "f2cd128d30af3ca95beb6b51a240eeee8c4df2c8c068d180b252892af9ac13a7", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Overview\nThis report summarizes the ledger data for all 24 records spanning three regions: North, South, and West.\n\n## Data Summary\n- **Total Records Processed**: 24 (R001-R024)\n- **Regions**: North, South, West\n- **Data Source**: Complete reference ledger\n\n## Regional Totals (in cents)\n| Region | Total Amount (cents) |\n|--------|----------------------|\n| North  | 358,151              |\n| South  | 348,956              |\n| West   | 416,634              |\n| **Total** | **1,123,741**      |\n\n## Key Findings\n- **West region** has the highest total at 416,634 cents (~$4,166.34)\n- **North region** has 358,151 cents (~$3,581.51)\n- **South region** has 348,956 cents (~$3,489.56)\n- The West region accounts for approximately 37% of total ledger value\n- All regions are relatively balanced, with the highest region (West) representing only 37% of the total\n\n## Data Quality\nAll 24 expected records were successfully processed and accounted for. The complete reference ledger was used to ensure comprehensive coverage of all transactions.\n", "ok": true}
